# Mazemind Tome: "{T}, Put a page counter on this artifact: Scry 1", "{2}, {T}, Put a page counter on this artifact: Draw a
# card" and "When there are four or more page counters on this artifact, exile it. If you do, you gain 4 life." Bot1 scries
# on turn 1, draws on turn 3 and scries on turn 5: three page counters, and the state trigger has not triggered (CR 603.8).
# On turn 7 the scry's cost puts the fourth counter: the state is true at once, so the trigger goes on the stack above the
# scry that caused it and resolves first - the Tome is exiled and Bot1 gains 4 life - and the scry then still happens
# (CR 608.2b: it has no target, and its source's absence changes nothing).

